    "html": "<!doctype html><html><head><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"A better equipped Erasmus+ 2028-2034 to address the EU’s strategic challenges | News | European Parliament\"/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"MEPs want a bigger budget for Erasmus+, the EU’s programme for learning mobility, to make it more accessible for young people of different economic, social and geographical backgrounds.\"/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.europarl.europa.eu/news/en/press-room/20261018IPR48265/a-better-equipped-erasmus-2028-2034-to-address-the-eu-s-strategic-challenges\"/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, noodp, noydir, notranslate, noarchive\"/></head><body><h1 class=\"ep_title\">\n                            <div class=\"ep-p_text\"><span class=\"ep_name\">A better equipped Erasmus+ 2028-2034 to address the EU’s strategic challenges</span><span class=\"ep_icon\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n                        </h1><time itemprop=\"datePublished\"\n              datetime=\"2026-10-22T12:26:00\">22-10-2026 - 12:26</time><div class=\"ep-a_text ep-layout_chapo\">\n                <p>MEPs want a bigger budget for Erasmus+, the EU’s programme for learning mobility, to make it more accessible for young people of different economic, social and geographical backgrounds.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ep-a_text\" data-wysiwyg><p class=\"ep-wysiwig_paragraph\">With 454 votes in favour to 34, and 93 abstentions, MEPs adopted their mandate for negotiations with EU member states on the Erasmus+ programme for 2028-2034.<br /><br /></p></div><ul><span class=\"ep_name\">Further information</span><span class=\"ep_icon\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n            </h2>\n            <ul class=\"ep_list\">\n                \n                    \n\n    \n\n        \n        \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n            \n                \n    <li>\n        <div class=\"ep-p_text ep-layout_page\">\n            <a title=\"Open in a new page\" href=\"/plenary/en/texts-adopted.html\"><span class=\"ep_name\">Adopted text will be available here (22.10.2026)</span><span class=\"ep_icon\">&nbsp;</span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </li>\n\n            \n        \n\n    \n\n\n                \n                    \n\n    \n\n        \n        \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n            \n                \n    <li>\n        <div class=\"ep-p_text ep-layout_page\">\n            <a title=\"Open in a new page\" href=\"/plenary/en/vod.html?mode=chapter&amp;vodLanguage=EN&amp;internalEPId=2017099858281&amp;providerMeetingId=20261021-0900-PLENARY#\"><span class=\"ep_name\">Video of the debate in plenary (21.10.2026)</span><span class=\"ep_icon\">&nbsp;</span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </li>\n\n            \n        \n\n    \n\n\n                \n                    \n\n    \n\n        \n        \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n            \n                \n    <li>\n        <div class=\"ep-p_text ep-layout_page\">\n            <a title=\"Open in a new page\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://multimedia.europarl.europa.eu/en/webstreaming/press-conference-by-bogdan-andrzej-zdrojewski-epp-pl-rapporteur-on-erasmus-programme-2028-2034_20261021-1100-SPECIAL-PRESSER\"><span class=\"ep_name\">Press conference with the rapporteur Bogdan Zdrojewski (21.10.2026)</span><span class=\"ep_icon\">&nbsp;</span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </li>\n\n            \n        \n\n    \n\n\n                \n                    \n\n    \n\n        \n        \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n            \n                \n    <li>\n        <div class=\"ep-p_text ep-layout_page\">\n            <a title=\"Open in a new page\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://oeil.europarl.europa.eu/oeil/en/procedure-file?reference=2025/0222(COD) \"><span class=\"ep_name\">Procedure file</span><span class=\"ep_icon\">&nbsp