    "html": "<!doctype html><html><head><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Methane rules: Parliament backs longer delay for energy importers and producers | News | European Parliament\"/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"MEPs voted on Thursday to delay methane monitoring and reporting rules for oil, gas and coal importers by three years – two more than proposed by the Commission.\"/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.europarl.europa.eu/news/en/press-room/20261021IPR48321/methane-rules-parliament-backs-longer-delay-for-energy-importers-and-producers\"/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, noodp, noydir, notranslate, noarchive\"/></head><body><h1 class=\"ep_title\">\n                            <div class=\"ep-p_text\"><span class=\"ep_name\">Methane rules: Parliament backs longer delay for energy importers and producers</span><span class=\"ep_icon\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n                        </h1><time itemprop=\"datePublished\"\n              datetime=\"2026-10-22T12:36:00\">22-10-2026 - 12:36</time><div class=\"ep-a_text ep-layout_chapo\">\n                <p>MEPs voted on Thursday to delay methane monitoring and reporting rules for oil, gas and coal importers by three years – two more than proposed by the Commission.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ep-a_text\" data-wysiwyg><p class=\"ep-wysiwig_paragraph\">Parliament adopted its position on the <a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/detail/en/ip_26_2119\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Commission’s proposal to postpone certain obligations under the EU Methane Regulation</a> by 341 votes in favour, 225 against and 6 abstentions.</p></div><ul><span class=\"ep_name\">Further information</span><span class=\"ep_icon\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n            </h2>\n            <ul class=\"ep_list\">\n                \n                    \n\n    \n\n        \n        \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n            \n                \n    <li>\n        <div class=\"ep-p_text ep-layout_page\">\n            <a title=\"Open in a new page\" href=\"/plenary/en/texts-adopted.html\"><span class=\"ep_name\">Adopted text will be available here (22.10.2026)</span><span class=\"ep_icon\">&nbsp;</span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </li>\n\n            \n        \n\n    \n\n\n                \n                    \n\n    \n\n        \n        \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n            \n                \n    <li>\n        <div class=\"ep-p_text ep-layout_page\">\n            <a title=\"Open in a new page\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://oeil.europarl.europa.eu/oeil/en/procedure-file?reference=2026/0325(COD)\"><span class=\"ep_name\">Procedure file</span><span class=\"ep_icon\">&nbsp;</span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </li>\n\n            \n        \n\n    \n\n\n                \n                    \n\n    \n\n        \n        \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n            \n                \n    <li>\n        <div class=\"ep-p_text ep-layout_page\">\n            <a title=\"Open in a new page\" href=\"/plenary/en/vod.html?mode=chapter&amp;vodLanguage=EN&amp;playerStartTime=20261006-15:24:56&amp;playerEndTime=20261006-16:30:01#\"><span class=\"ep_name\">Video: Debate with Energy Commissioner Dan Jørgensen on the implementation of the methane regulation (6.10.2026)</span><span class=\"ep_icon\">&nbsp;</span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </li>\n\n            \n        \n\n    \n\n\n                \n            </ul></body></html>"
